  "meta": {
    "name": "Prime plus 261030-1",
    "description": "PRIME PLUS for pump 261030-1: pump TILTED OUTLET-UP, outlet vented to waste, no syringe pressure (pressure control off); keep the tilt for the following test. 3 x [2 Hz 30 s, 0 Hz 5 s, 1000 Hz 10 s, 1300 Hz 10 s, 1600 Hz 10 s, 0 Hz 5 s, 600 Hz 45 s, 0 Hz 10 s] at 2.5 V: the 2 Hz strokes are full travel (~200-280 nL) to move gas, 1000-1600 Hz prime, 600 Hz flushes (2000 Hz is left out: it barely pumps in the current state). Then CHECKS: 600 Hz 20 s and 1300 Hz 20 s. Pass: about 200 uL/min or more at 600 Hz and about 250 or more at 1300 Hz; else run it again. Voltages by the RSD3305P, PPK2 on.",
